sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant SocketServer as Socket.IO Server
    participant Handler as SocketHandler

    Client->>SocketServer: emit activity:leave {trip_id, trip_date}
    SocketServer->>Handler: ActivityLeave
    Handler->>Handler: leave room, update SocketContext
    Handler-->>SocketServer: emit activity:leave {success, message}
    SocketServer-->>Client: activity:leave {success, message}
